    Normalize section-tracking attributes on live page sections
    
    Remove hardcoded data-section-index so the section tracker derives DOM
    order itself (a fixed index competed with that count and reported the
    same section under different indexes for different visitors, corrupting
    drop-off data).
    
    Add data-drye-section + a stable, unique snake_case data-section-name to
    sections that lacked one. Existing data-section-name values, data-section-id,
    element ids and script blocks are left untouched.
    
    Scope: sections rendered on the product page, how-it-works, why-drye,
    research, field-reports blog, contact, and policy pages (47 files).
    
